Play-by-play packs (data/packs/)
Made from nflverse play-by-play data (https://github.com/nflverse/nflverse-data), published under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Changes made: penalty and no-play rows removed; plays grouped into game situations and counted; pass-play models fitted from the same rows.

